# A whole round of Journey stage 1 to the results card, driving the real UI:
# the pointer on the title, then the board by keyboard (a click focuses a
# cell; arrows move from cell to cell, Enter plays it, D delivers), following
# the rules engine's hint line (the stage is seeded, so the board is the same
# every run). Then Play again starts a new round.
until 300 Play
frames 10
click Play
until 120 Restoration tasks
frames 5
# 1. merge row 1 column 2 into row 1 column 3 (two Candle Lamps)
click Candle Lamp
until 30 Candle Lamp selected
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
until 30 Merged into Pier Lantern
# 2. deliver the Pier Lantern: the lamp task is done
key Enter 2
until 30 Pier Lantern selected
key KeyD 2
until 30 Hang the pier lamp complete!
# 3. merge row 1 column 5 into row 2 column 5
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
until 30 selected
key ArrowDown 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
until 30 Merged into Pier Lantern
# 4. move the Mallet from row 2 column 2 to row 3 column 1
key ArrowLeft 2
frames 2
key ArrowLeft 2
frames 2
key ArrowLeft 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
until 30 Mallet selected
key ArrowDown 2
frames 2
key ArrowLeft 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
until 30 Tool moved.
# 5. merge it with the Mallet below it
key Enter 2
until 30 Mallet selected
key ArrowDown 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
until 30 Merged into Claw Hammer
# 6. move the Twine from row 3 column 5 to row 4 column 2
key ArrowUp 2
frames 2
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
until 30 Twine selected
key ArrowDown 2
frames 2
key ArrowLeft 2
frames 2
key ArrowLeft 2
frames 2
key ArrowLeft 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
until 30 Tool moved.
# 7. merge it with the Twine at row 5 column 1
key Enter 2
until 30 Twine selected
key ArrowDown 2
frames 2
key ArrowLeft 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
until 30 Merged into Rope Coil
# 8. deliver the Rope Coil: every task is done
key Enter 2
until 30 Rope Coil selected
key KeyD 2
until 60 Harbor restored!
until 200 Play again
frames 150
save results
click Play again
until 120 Restoration tasks
expect Moves0
